{"version":1,"content":"<p>國際KM3NeT合作組利用地中海海底的ORCA中微子探測器，檢驗愛因斯坦相對論中的洛倫茲不變性。研究團隊分析了持續1.4年的觀測數據，共篩選出5828個大氣中微子候選事件；結果沒有發現這一基本對稱性遭到破壞的跡象，但為若干可能的偏離設定了新的實驗限制。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585702.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.153539+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:48:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"8699efe9e5b5548b193ad9023337311876da97bde126c19a7251b01c6b911142","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}